  DisplayName: Blastline
  Description: 'Wrasse and Grouper only - clean the overgrown reef. The Wrasse loops its tail round
    Space motes and a blast goes off where the loop closed, destroying hostile prisms and
    sparing yours; the more motes in the loop, the bigger the blast. Between blasts the
    kite''s head pops what it touches. Gather Space crystals and more Space motes come to
    the board. Higher intensities grow a wilder forest and thin the crystals. First team to
    the target wins.'
